Did you check waveforms at Slave side, are they changing?=20

We have validated Slave support by making one channel as slave and other =
channel as Master on same 2430 SDP by shorting the connections =
externally on same board. We have not used two SDPs.

I remember some one reporting some issues when length of the cable =
between two boards was more than some limit.

Why are you looking for Slave SPI support? I can pass you our driver =
that does support slave support with few changes in SPI stack. We didn't =
publish to community as it was breaking few other drivers.

Or you can try using SPI driver in 2.6.14 kernel from linux.omap.com, =
even this is tested as mentioned above.

